Icons in this folder come from three open-source sets. The logos themselves
are trademarks of their respective owners.

AI Stack (claude, deepseek, gemini, kimi-*, openai-*, zai-*):
  @lobehub/icons-static-png 1.97.1, https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons, MIT (below)

Tech Stack, full colour (python, typescript, javascript, swift, go, postgresql, docker, git, vscode):
  devicon 2.16.0, https://github.com/devicons/devicon, MIT (below)

Tech Stack, single colour (bash, astro, linux, rust-*, webgl-*):
  simple-icons 13.21.0, https://github.com/simple-icons/simple-icons, CC0 1.0 (public domain);
  coloured here with each brand's colour, or white/black for dark/light pages

